# Copy to ~/.pi/tools/.env and `chmod 600` it. One NAME=value a line, read
# literally: no `$` expansion, no `export`. Every script tool starts with
# these in its environment; `bash` never sees them. A variable already set in
# pi's own environment wins over the file.

# judge: the judgment endpoint's key, and optional overrides.
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=
# JUDGE_BASE_URL=https://api.typesafe.ai/v1
# JUDGE_MODEL=jev-latest
